StreamCore

One Ecosystem. Every Platform.

StreamCore is a collection of streaming tools designed to bring multi-platform streaming management, chat integration, and moderation together under one ecosystem.

Built to support both streamers and moderators, StreamCore aims to simplify the challenges of managing multiple streaming platforms by providing dedicated tools for different roles within a live broadcast environment.

Currently, StreamCore is focused on Twitch, YouTube, and Kick integration.

Applications

🛡️ Mod Deck

Multi-Platform Moderation Toolkit

Mod Deck is a dedicated moderation multitool designed for moderators managing multiple streaming communities.

It brings Twitch, YouTube, and Kick chat moderation into one centralized interface, allowing moderators to monitor and manage conversations across all three platforms simultaneously.

Designed for:

Twitch moderators

YouTube moderators

Kick moderators

Moderation teams managing multiple platforms

💬 Stream Chat

Multi-Platform Chat Integration for OBS

Stream Chat is designed to bring messages from Twitch, YouTube, and Kick together into a unified chat experience for streamers.

Designed with OBS integration in mind, it aims to provide streamers with a centralized way to view messages from multiple platforms without needing separate chat windows for each service.

Designed for:

Multistreamers

Twitch streamers

YouTube streamers

Kick streamers

OBS users

